<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<h1 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Verdana;"><font color="#666666"><br></font></span></h1><h1 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Verdana;"><font color="#666666">Get Started Today!</font></span></h1>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;">{!Lead.FirstName},<br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">I have received your application you submitted through the
National Funding website and I am attempting to process it, but I still require
a few items to complete your application and get you an accurate quote for your
business.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">To complete your application I will need you to
compile the following documents, if you have not already done so:&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><li><p>Complete and sign the attached Merchant Prequalification Form</p></li><li><p>Collect the last 6 months of your business' bank statements</p></li><li><p>Collect the last 4 months of merchant account statements, if you business accepts credit cards</p></li><li><p>Collect the first page of your most recent tax return</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">Once you have compiled all the necessary documentation
listed above, you can fax it to me at {!User.Fax}, or scan and email it to me
at {!Lead.OwnerEmail}.&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">Remember, unlike many of our competitors, National Funding
offers a variety financial services for businesses nationwide, including
business loans, merchant cash advances, equipment financing, and credit card
processing. With our numerous services and options, chances are we can tailor
financing for your business that also meets your budget. If you have any
questions, please do not hesitate to contact me directly; my contact
information is in my signature below.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;">I look forward to hearing from you!&nbsp;<br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Lead.OwnerFullName}</span><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">National Funding</strong><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Phone:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerPhone}</span><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Email:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerEmail}</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="font-size: 7.5pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt;"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif">If you no longer wish to receive emails from&nbsp;National Funding, send an email to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:emailreply@nationalfunding.com">emailreply@nationalfunding.com</a>&nbsp;with Unsubscribe in the subject line. You may also unsubscribe by sending written notice to:&nbsp;National Funding&nbsp;Unsubscribe<br>&nbsp;9530 Towne Centre Dr., Suite 120, San Diego, CA 92121. Thank you.&nbsp;<br>National Funding&nbsp;</font></font></font></span></font></font></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">respects your privacy. Our commitment to your privacy is described in our Privacy Policy which is available on our Web site for your reference.&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">© 2018 National Funding. &nbsp;All Rights Reserved.&nbsp;</span>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>